# Python tooling
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# The pinned schema validator's virtualenv, created inside the checkout by
# every workflow. It is a build input, not source.
/.ci-schema-validator/

# Local agent tooling. The task ledger and the plans it was written from are the
# development harness's own output, not project documentation: the plans carry task
# checkboxes that stay unticked for work that is in fact finished, which reads as
# unfinished work in a public repository. The design record that is meant to be read
# lives in docs/adr/ and docs/architecture/.
/.superpowers/
/docs/superpowers/
# The design harness's working state (review captures, build state, mocks,
# surface briefs, and the token mirror) is machine-local output, the same
# class as .superpowers/: the durable records are PRODUCT.md and DESIGN.md.
/.impeccable/

# Generated engine artifacts
/LibXray.xcframework/
/LibXray.xcframework.zip
/Libbox.xcframework/
